  {
    "id": 2009007020020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n海です！　気持ちいいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当だなぁ……\r\n早く来てよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だけど、この後撮影もあるし、\r\nはしゃぎすぎないようにな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！\r\n了解です、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ならオーケーだ\r\n好きにしておいで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わーいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "se": "0262",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（今年は海に来るの初めてだって言ってたもんな\r\n──はは、楽しそうだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんっ、来てください！\r\nスゴいもの見つけちゃいましたーっ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、どうしたー？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0583",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ほらっ、スッゴくきれいな──石？　が\r\nいっぱいあるんです！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "丸くてキラキラで、\r\nでも、ちょっとグミみたいにも見えます……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "誰かが落としちゃったんでしょうか……！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それはな\r\nビーチグラスっていうんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ビーチグラス……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900702/2009007020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もともとは、ビンとかのガラスなんだけど\r\n波に揉まれるうちに、角が取れて石みたいになるんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これは、海が作ったものなんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009007020100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "海が……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
